installed: yes
== 1. the approval arms the run (presence-guard, ExitPlanMode in auto mode) ==
allow:not-question
  rc=0
  approved: present
  armed line 1: <epoch>
  armed line 3: reentries 0
== 2. a hung job: killed at its budget, retried once, exit 4, nothing left behind ==
  wait rc=4
  ⛔ hang timed out — killed after 2s, 2 attempts · log: <reg>/hang/log · park it: bash ops/polaris defer -m "hang hung" -- sh <fix>/hang.sh
  children started: 4 · alive: 0
== 3. the Stop gate reads the armed file: work left blocks, the third identical block is a stall ==
  block:run
  block:run
  allow:stalled
  stalled: yes · notify: notify-gate stall
== 4. defer one command, then finish: parked, one line waiting, the armed file gone ==
  deferred: git push origin main — finish lists it
  finish rc=1
  ⛔ finish: parked - 1 waiting on you
  ⛔ waiting on you: git push origin main - the release push needs a token
  run: <the run line>
  armed: 0 · parked: aw.parked 
== 5. the pulse reads finish's parked file ==
  parked
